{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51877","headline":"简池（句）（简池独刘氏三溪号一郡之胜。） · 无名氏","name":"简池（句）（简池独刘氏三溪号一郡之胜。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入蜀最宜游简郡，寻山须是访刘家。\n（《舆地纪胜》一四五《简州》）（〖1〗诗後原注：「此古诗也，简池独刘氏三溪号一郡之胜。\n」刘氏指刘昊，北宋天圣中人，其先人唐僖宗时迁简州。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}